WEBVTT

00:22:26.276 --> 00:22:31.036
that's what, in my view,
gave rise to any kind of perception.

00:22:31.036 --> 00:22:32.596
In order to regulate something,

00:22:32.596 --> 00:22:35.076
you need to be able to predict
what happens to it.

00:22:35.116 --> 00:22:38.636
It's this whole apparatus
of prediction and prediction error

00:22:38.676 --> 00:22:41.076
that undergirds all
of our perceptual experiences,

00:22:41.076 --> 00:22:42.476
including the self,

00:22:42.516 --> 00:22:45.316
has its origin in this role

00:22:45.316 --> 00:22:48.236
that's tightly coupled
to the physiology of the body.

00:22:48.236 --> 00:22:50.556
And that's why, I think,
we're feeling machines,

00:22:50.556 --> 00:22:52.516
we're not just computers

00:22:52.556 --> 00:22:55.916
that happen to be implemented
on meat machines.

00:22:55.956 --> 00:22:58.876
DB: Thank you, Anil,
for chatting with us today.

00:22:58.876 --> 00:23:00.036
AS: Really enjoyed it.